<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates narrow, one-week up.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates narrow, one-week up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight interbank rates narrowed on Sunday in a short private sector market to between 10 and 10 7/16 percent from 10 and 10 1/8 percent on Thursday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates on the pound rose to between 10 1/4 and 10 7/16 from Thursday's 10 1/8 and 10 1/4 percent.</p>
<p>Public sector banks still maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
